@ai-jz, thanks for helping move this fix forward and crediting the original work. After comparing both implementations, this appears to be a narrower version of the same zero-value reporting fix from #28801, with a different helper structure and the legacy Completions addition left out.

I've now opened #44010 as a smaller-scoped continuation of my original PR, preserving the original implementation and leaving that separate addition out. I'd suggest we use that PR to move the fix forward, and I'm happy to collaborate on any further updates needed for review.

For changes that mainly narrow an existing contribution, I'd appreciate being asked to update the original PR first so we can preserve authorship as we collaborate. If the solution is substantially different, a separate PR is of course fine.

